   "ANSWER": "<p data-end=\"2891\" data-start=\"2855\">CMP R0, #0 &nbsp;<br />\nADDEQ R1, R1, R2 &nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2891\" data-start=\"2855\">Execution depends on Z flag in CPSR (set if R0 = 0)</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2007\" data-start=\"1914\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
